Third-party data attributions
-----------------------------
configs/airframes/aerosonde_bm.yaml contains numerical aircraft parameters from
R. W. Beard and T. W. McLain, "Small Unmanned Aircraft: Theory and Practice",
Princeton University Press, 2012 (and the propeller/motor addendum by T. W. McLain),
as published in byu-magicc/mavsim_public (mavsim_python/parameters/aerosonde_parameters.py,
commit 10363e0eaeb16a61a7463505f8e122a9eb7e2b4e). Only parameter values are used;
no source code from that repository is included.

configs/sites/cambridge_west.osm.json is an extract of OpenStreetMap data
(© OpenStreetMap contributors), made with tools/fetch_gazetteer.py. It is available
under the Open Database License 1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/);
see https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. The extract stays under the ODbL.

configs/worlds/london.world.npz (with configs/worlds/london.yaml and the operations in
configs/sites/london.yaml) is a database derived from OpenStreetMap data (© OpenStreetMap
contributors) and from Environment Agency LIDAR Composite DSM and DTM (1 m), made with
tools/london_bake.py. It is available under the Open Database License 1.0; see
configs/worlds/LICENCE-london.md for the attributions and terms.

web/skyview/public/textures/ holds photographs under CC0 1.0 (ambientCG, Poly Haven); see
the README there.
